{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">位於內蒙古騰格里沙漠深處的烏蘭湖，每到夏季，湖內的藻類因為高溫釋放天然色素，將整片湖水染成鮮紅。由高空俯瞰，彷彿地球的心臟。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.NMG.SAND.MTV.0811-0901_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20262I9S44HQMN1788227482.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.NMG.SAND.MTV.0811-0901_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T02:19:46.370319+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":62,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}